and well-being.</p>\n\n<div  class=\"iconlist\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-iconsize=\"md\">\n    <ul role=\"list\">\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon has-check-green-color\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\">Responsive Service </p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Your satisfaction is our top priority. We go above and beyond to address your needs promptly and efficiently. Trust us for solid solutions and exceptional support.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon has-check-green-color\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\">Expert Technicians</p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Our technicians are highly skilled and experienced in their respective fields. With attention to detail and a commitment to excellence, they deliver top-notch service and solutions.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon has-check-green-color\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\">Transparent Communication</p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Our team ensures clear and open dialogue, keeping you informed every step of the way. Expect honesty, clarity, and integrity in all our interactions.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon has-check-green-color\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\">Quality Workmanship</p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>From installation to maintenance and repairs, we strive for excellence in every job we undertake. Your project is in capable hands with our unmatched workmanship.</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n            </ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"our-community\" class=\"container splitter mobile-flip-splitter has-background has-white-background-color\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--center splitter-column--padded-edge\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"wp-block-site-logo\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"custom-logo-link\" rel=\"home\" aria-current=\"page\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"69\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Happy-Home-Services-logo.png\" class=\"custom-logo\" alt=\"Happy Home Services, a NearU Company, logo, an HVAC, Plumbing, and Indoor Air Quality services company in Durham, NC\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/Happy-Home-Services-logo.png 800w, /images/2024/03/Happy-Home-Services-logo-300x104.png 300w, /images/2024/03/Happy-Home-Services-logo-768x265.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" /></a></div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading h-decorator h-decorator--primary has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-3\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600\">Serving the Greater Durham &amp; Chapel Hill Communities for 70 Years!</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Happy Home Services has been the trusted HVAC and plumbing company in <strong>Greater Durham</strong> and <strong>Chapel H