title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>We have been using Happy Home for quite a few years and are always pleased with the professionalism and thorough work. The techs arrive on time and recently caught a major issue that we were unaware of. Thankfully it was still under warranty and it was repaired quickly.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Kaye\" aria-label=\"Kaye\">Kaye</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>The technician and supervisor were professional, knowledgeable, thorough, provided video and photo evidence of issues of concern, and overall provided exceptional trustworthy service. I will never use any other service.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Keisha A.\" aria-label=\"Keisha A.\">Keisha A.</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>Great customer service. They were very attentive toward our needs. Our service tech (repair man) was kind, knowledgeable and very personable. He made sure the problem was fixed prior to leaving our home. We were very pleased with his work.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n            </div>\n    <!-- ./ review carousel -->\n    <div class=\"nearu-carousel-controls\">\n\t<div class=\"nearu-carousel-button button-prev\">    <div class=\"